<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>DTS on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/dts/</link><description>Recent content in DTS on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/dts/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>视频为什么能压缩上百倍：冗余、YUV 与 I/P/B 帧、GOP</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/network/video-compression-fundamentals/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/network/video-compression-fundamentals/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../web-video-codec-survey/"&gt;后文的浏览器编码选型&lt;/a&gt;与&lt;a href="../streaming-protocols-survey/"&gt;流媒体协议全景&lt;/a&gt;会反复跟 H.264、I 帧、GOP 这些概念打交道——先把它们本身讲清楚，后面两篇才有落点。这篇补底层：视频从一串像素变成几 Mbps 的码流，中间发生了什么。不讲数学推导，讲机制——每个概念配上它在工程里的后果（延迟、seek、花屏、存储）。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>